    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "#### This unit represents a fundamental change in computer science learning. Students move from writing code line by line to directing, evaluating, and refining what AI produces.\r\n\r\n## Supporting Students with AI + JavaScript\r\n\r\n#### Click each card to see coaching moves and strategies you can use when students get stuck.\r\n\r\n<div style=\"max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;\">\r\n  <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 16px; justify-content: space-between;\">\r\n\r\n<!-- Card 1 -->\r\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 16px); min-width: 300px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n      <details style=\"border: 2px solid #048899; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; background-color: #ffffff;\">\r\n        <summary style=\"background-color: #048899; color: #ffffff; padding: 18px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; list-style: none;\">\r\n          ⚙️ Writing JavaScript<br>\r\n          <span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic; font-weight: normal;\">Students don’t know where to start</span>\r\n        </summary>\r\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px; border-top: 2px solid #048899;\">\r\n          <p style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px;\">Coaching Moves</p>\r\n          <ul style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0;\">\r\n            <li>What feature are you trying to build?</li>\r\n            <li>What should happen when the user clicks?</li>\r\n            <li>Where should that go in your code?</li>\r\n          </ul>\r\n          <div style=\"background-color: #B7E0E5; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px;\">\r\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0;\">Strategy</p>\r\n            <ul style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 0;\">\r\n              <li><strong>Be specific:</strong> name the feature + action</li>\r\n              <li><strong>Stay focused:</strong> work on one feature at a time</li>\r\n              <li><strong>Refine the code:</strong> Generate → Analyze → Modify</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </details>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n<!-- Card 2 -->\r\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 16px); min-width: 300px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n      <details style=\"border: 2px solid #8148B2; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; background-color: #ffffff;\">\r\n        <summary style=\"background-color: #8148B2; color: #ffffff; padding: 18px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; list-style: none;\">\r\n          🐞 Debugging Code<br>\r\n          <span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic; font-weight: normal;\">Students say “it’s just broken”</span>\r\n        </summary>\r\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px; border-top: 2px solid #8148B2;\">\r\n          <p style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px;\">Coaching Moves</p>\r\n          <ul style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0;\">\r\n            <li>What is this supposed to do?</li>\r\n            <li>What is it doing instead?</li>\r\n            <li>Where does it stop working?</li>\r\n          </ul>\r\n          <div style=\"background-color: #DECEEA; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px;\">\r\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0;\">Strategy</p>\r\n            <ul style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 0;\">\r\n              <li><strong>Break it down:</strong> test one part at a time</li>\r\n              <li><strong>Trace the logic:</strong> follow the code step-by-step</li>\r\n              <li><strong>Refine the code:</strong> Generate → Analyze → Modify</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </details>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n<!-- Card 3 -->\r\n<div style=\"flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 16px); min-width: 300px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n      <details style=\"border: 2px solid #C95B5B; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; background-color: #ffffff;\">\r\n        <summary style=\"background-color: #C95B5B; color: #ffffff; padding: 18px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; list-style: none;\">\r\n          💬 Prompting the AI<br>\r\n          <span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic; font-weight: normal;\">Students say “the AI isn’t helping”</span>\r\n        </summary>\r\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px; border-top: 2px solid #C95B5B;\">\r\n          <p style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px;\">Coaching Moves</p>\r\n          <ul style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0;\">\r\n            <li>What are you trying to build?</li>\r\n            <li>What specific feature should the AI focus on?</li>\r\n            <li>How can your request be more specific?</li>\r\n          </ul>\r\n          <div style=\"background-color: #F2D6D6; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px;\">\r\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0;\">Strategy</p>\r\n            <ul style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 0;\">\r\n              <li><strong>Be clear:</strong> describe the feature + what it should do</li>\r\n              <li><strong>Stay focused:</strong> prompt one feature at a time</li>\r\n              <li><strong>Refine the prompt:</strong> revise and try again</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </details>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n<!-- Card 4 -->\r\n  <div style=\"flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 16px); min-width: 300px; box-sizing: border-box;\">\r\n      <details style=\"border: 2px solid #4DAA64; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; background-color: #ffffff;\">\r\n        <summary style=\"background-color: #4DAA64; color: #ffffff; padding: 18px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold; list-style: none;\">\r\n          🔍 Understanding AI Code<br>\r\n          <span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-style: italic; font-weight: normal;\">Students copy AI without understanding</span>\r\n        </summary>\r\n        <div style=\"padding: 18px; border-top: 2px solid #4DAA64;\">\r\n          <p style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 10px;\">Coaching Moves</p>\r\n          <ul style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 0;\">\r\n            <li>What part of this makes sense?</li>\r\n            <li>What would you change or improve?</li>\r\n            <li>Why did the AI do this?</li>\r\n          </ul>\r\n          <div style=\"background-color: #C9F0D0; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px;\">\r\n            <p style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0;\">Strategy</p>\r\n            <ul style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 0;\">\r\n              <li><strong>Think it through:</strong> don’t copy—understand</li>\r\n              <li><strong>Check the output:</strong> does it do what you asked?</li>\r\n              <li><strong>Refine the code:</strong> Generate → Analyze → Modify</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </details>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n## update the video "
  },
